  triage:description "quality-mgr BB2-QA2-1789248000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1444#issuecomment-5648627854, 2026-09-12T20:54:11Z; B2, arch-qa ARCH-001, confirmed by quality-mgr via direct read), reviewed at ef7572fd0. .claude/skills/triaging-findings/SKILL.md:376-382 ('ATM Message Contract') still lists the four-step sequence ending in '4. completion ACK by receiver' -- the exact stale step BB2-002 was filed to remove. This now directly contradicts codex-orchestration/SKILL.md:255 and graph-orchestration/SKILL.md:565, both of which this round correctly fixed to state there is no completion ACK by the receiver. ruthless-boundary-qa's sweep reported no other file carries the old requirement, but its search evidently matched only the corrected sentence and missed this file's differently-worded stale list; quality-mgr's direct read resolves the conflict in arch-qa's favor." ;
